    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 32,
       "endIndex": 147,
       "text": "This is an **above-average initial offer** for a Google L6 Product Manager, but **you should definitely negotiate**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 265,
       "endIndex": 425,
       "text": "Accepting the first offer would leave significant money on the table\u2014especially given the lack of a sign-on bonus and Google\u2019s front-loaded vesting schedule"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 521,
       "endIndex": 645,
       "text": "Google uses a **front-loaded vesting schedule** for initial equity grants (typically **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** over 4 years)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1142,
       "endIndex": 1349,
       "text": "**Market Benchmark:** The median Google L6 PM total compensation in the Bay Area sits around **$480,000\u2013$530,000/year**, with top-of-band / competitive packages reaching **$600,000\u2013$680,000+** annualized"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1425,
       "endIndex": 1578,
       "text": "**Initial Equity Grant ($1.08M):** At $270k/year average ($356k in Y1/Y2), this is already near the 65th\u201370th percentile for standard L6 initial grants"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1582,
       "endIndex": 1658,
       "text": "**Level Mapping:** Meta IC6 to Google L6 is an accurate, lateral level match"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1686,
       "endIndex": 1847,
       "text": "**No Sign-On Bonus ($0):** Google frequently uses sign-on bonuses to offset unvested equity or unvested annual bonus cycles when poaching senior talent from Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1849,
       "endIndex": 1916,
       "text": "At L6, sign-on bonuses often land between **$50,000 and $100,000+**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2073,
       "endIndex": 2279,
       "text": "**The Year 3\u20134 Equity Cliff:** Because initial grants drop from 33% down to 22% and 12%, you will be heavily dependent on annual refresher grants (which vest 25%/year) to maintain your Year 1/2 total comp"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2281,
       "endIndex": 2360,
       "text": "Meta's PM refresher culture is known to be among the most lucrative in big tech"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2467,
       "endIndex": 2585,
       "text": "When negotiating with Google, focus on **Sign-on Bonus**, **Equity**, and **Base Salary** in that order of flexibility"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2677,
       "endIndex": 2806,
       "text": "| **Sign-on Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Offsets leaving Meta's upcoming bonus/vesting cycle and bridges Year 1 cash"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2810,
       "endIndex": 2957,
       "text": "| **RSU Grant (4-Yr)** | $1,080,000 | **$1,200,000 \u2013 $1,250,000** | Offsets Meta's equity refresh trajectory and mitigates Google's Year 3/4 drop"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3141,
       "endIndex": 3375,
       "text": "Since you are happy at Meta and were passively recruited, you have the ideal negotiating posture: polite, enthusiastic about the team, but firm that the financial delta must justify walking away from your current equity and trajectory"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4391,
       "endIndex": 4490,
       "text": "**Do not accept as-is:** You have no risk of the offer being rescinded by professionally countering"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       6
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4494,
       "endIndex": 4664,
       "text": "**Do not walk away yet:** Google's compensation committee frequently adjusts initial offers for strong passive Meta candidates when presented with clear counter-proposals"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       0,
       6
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4668,
       "endIndex": 4756,
       "text": "**Bottom line:** Push for a **$75k\u2013$100k sign-on bonus** and a **~$1.2M equity grant**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
